{"id":"649141","name":"家常炒米粉","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/649141/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"米粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"50g"},{"name":"青菜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"一截"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱头","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"米粉。","img":"images/649141/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青菜、胡萝卜、肉、葱头。","img":"images/649141/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"分别切好。","img":"images/649141/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"起锅烧油，肉片入锅炒。","img":"images/649141/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"肉片炒熟，放入葱丝。","img":"images/649141/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入胡萝卜丝炒软。","img":"images/649141/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一点沙茶酱。","img":"images/649141/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"炒匀入味。","img":"images/649141/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入青菜。","img":"images/649141/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入米粉。","img":"images/649141/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"加入酱油和胡椒粉。","img":"images/649141/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"翻炒入味即可。","img":"images/649141/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。干香爽滑，非常好吃。","img":"images/649141/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}